-- src:552 | Đơn vị quỹ sẽ được rút toàn bộ theo Giá trị hoàn lại được xác
-- src:553 | định vào Ngày định giá kế tiếp sau ngày công ty nhận đơn yêu
-- src:554 | cầu huỷ Hợp đồng.
@ref Article 12 (src 549-551)
GIVEN `in force`                          IS A BOOLEAN
      `a written request on the Company's form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 12 — the Policyholder may surrender the contract, it being in force:` `in force` `; requested in writing on the form:` `a written request on the Company's form` MEANS
        `in force`
    AND `a written request on the Company's form`

@ref Article 12 (src 551-554)
GIVEN `the date received` IS A DATE
      `the valuations`    IS A LIST OF `A valuation of the account`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 12 — the surrender payment for a request received on` `the date received` `, among` `the valuations` MEANS
    `the surrender value on the next Valuation Date after` `the date received` `among` `the valuations`
